          <a href="#max-heart-rate" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">2. The Problem With 220 Minus Age</a>
          <a href="#five-zones" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">3. The Five Zones</a>
          <a href="#zone-two" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">4. Why Zone 2 Gets All the Attention</a>
